*** Begin ECU Patch
Key: 026-publish-platform-dependency
Title: Publish the platform dependency
Purpose: Make every public Ekairos package externally installable and fail releases that reference unpublished workspace dependencies.

*** Begin Context
An external install of the newly published Reactor beta failed because @ekairos/domain and @ekairos/cli depend on @ekairos/platform, which was built but absent from the release graph. The release check now enforces publish, prepare, and link closure.
*** End Context

